WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:05.040
Another Thing That Doctor Bright Is Not Allowed
To Do At The Foundation: Don't let Dr. Bright

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:07.680
get a sample of SCP-379.

00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:10.480
Let my laptop be the last victim.

00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:15.120
SCP-379 is a clear liquid nicknamed the Mechanical
Pheremone.

00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:19.920
Once applied, any machines in its proximity
will begin to act as though they’re sentient,

00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:25.520
infatuated beings, including overheating,
slower response time, a preference in contact

00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:28.160
with the wearer, and a higher rate of glitches.

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:32.800
Dr. Bright may think it’s funny to spritz
a little SCP-379 and take a walk through one

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:38.160
of Site-19’s IT wings, but Technical Director
Rosen ardently disagrees.

